====================================================
KEY TAKEAWAYS
====================================================

Cloud architecture is more than learning cloud services.
Production systems require scalability, security, observability, and operational discipline.
System design thinking is essential for cloud engineers.
Strong backend engineering fundamentals directly support cloud architecture growth.

Day 10 focused on thinking like a Cloud Architect instead of only learning tools.